        "description": "I walked into a busy street auction in Karachi that looked like easy bargains\u2026 until I stopped and watched closely.\n\nThe same bidders kept appearing, winners didn\u2019t leave, and strangers were pressured to join the bidding. These setups are known as mock auctions - fast, loud, and designed to make you overpay before you realise what\u2019s happening.\n\nIf a deal feels too good to be true while traveling, slow down and observe first. This is a fake auction scam.\n\nHave you ever seen something like this?",
